sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Vehicle
  participant IV as CMP-001 InputValidator
  participant AR as CMP-002 DoorLockArbiter
  participant CH as CMP-002a CrashReleaseHandler
  participant SF as CMP-002b SensorFaultHandler
  participant AH as CMP-002c ApproachRiskHandler
  participant OP as CMP-003 OutputPublisher
  V->>IV: rear_left_approach_risk=TRUE (OEM-IF-003)
  IV->>AR: getValidatedSignal()
  AR->>CH: tryHandle(...)
  CH-->>AR: handled=false
  AR->>SF: tryHandle(...)
  SF-->>AR: handled=false (sensor_fault=false)
  AR->>AH: tryHandle(...)
  AH-->>AR: handled=true, LEFT=LOCK, reason=SUPPRESSED_APPROACH_RISK [SWR-005/006/009]
  AR->>OP: publish(decision)
